==Trivia==
*All stages from [[Darararah (Cats of the Cosmos)|Darararah]] through Ababwa have a robot (from the [[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|''Mobile Suit Gundam'']] series) on top of their base, with the lower half being the Pegasus White Base.
*Ababwa on the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] map looks somewhat like [[wikia:gundam:A Baoa Qu|A Baoa Qu]], a space fortress in ''Mobile Suit Gundam''. Ababwa's Japanese name is also vaguely similar, that being Aba Bua (アバ・ブア).

